    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 854820,
      "end_ms": 858900,
      "text": "一般叫小什么小李小李专门有个城中村"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 858900,
      "end_ms": 860880,
      "text": "有好多这种东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 861460,
      "end_ms": 862680,
      "text": "只不过我们强调这一点啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 862680,
      "end_ms": 863610,
      "text": "我们强调这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 863610,
      "end_ms": 868740,
